        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtas tagh kömöy kïngwanit ompö koro Kanan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kïkany otini kiwonyö omisyonay kikipunö koro Misri, kïlenchï Yakopo werkachi, “Omïlisyenö Misri ngat atape olwecha omisyö kite.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kïlenchï Yuda kwanta, “Kirirwecha chichoni wowö korononi nyoman lö, ‘Mosïwïyanïkwanye ato mamïtukwanye werïnkwa nyo mïnïng.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyo ato ipïsunyi werïncha kïwö nko acha, kepetecha nyu kyolu omisyö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo ato mechömunyinye kïwö nko acha, kïmelö kïpetecha wölini, ompöwölo kimwowecha chichoni lasiny lö, ‘Mosïwïyanïkwanye ato mamïtukwanye werïnkwa nyo mïnïng.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö Israel, “Kilö ne tokonanïkwa nyarïl omwochï chichoni lö kitökïmi werïnkwa anka?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyokyï chane lö, “Kiteptepecha chichoni nyoman ngaleko piköcha. Kitepecha lö, ‘Tökïsatate paponkwa? Atïngetekwa werïnkwa anka?’ Keyokyicha nyu kïrïp kegh nko teputkachi. Kimi ngo nyo kinkït lö kilenchinecha, ‘Ape amïtuna werïngwo?’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Yuda paponyi Israel, “Pïswante owö nko nyinte tökepe lawel kyala omisyö tömökiwonyö löwïr ompö kömöy, nyi nko acha nko monïnge chï mïnkech. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nya kïlïkwï ani nyo oghyongchini nyinte. Ighokaninyi nyinte. Ato moyokwanye nyinte ntesïweghenyi konyiku, ikany onyorwan kigheghchin kokay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ompöwölo ntömökeropucha, kötökakepkancha akemïlonchö panto odeny.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï papongwa Israel chane, “Ato mïchini kïlïkwï nyoni, agh nyu le nyï. Opchinö ompö mïlotwekwo wowïnoni tïkwïn cho pïchighöch nyoman cho pkono korenyo kïlïkwï ropöw. Opchinö nyinte mwowöy cho ngörï nko kumat kite nko tïkwïn cho ngutoy cho onyïn nko akwa mlosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anamata ropïyen kïnyïl odeny cho mïchini ompöwölo mötïnye keyoda ropïyenichay kikitö mïlotwekwa, ompöwölo töptoy kiwutyeghö chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apa tïkwïl nko werïngwo, wölini mito chichoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "osoghan Tororöt Kimuktoghin kusoyönokwa tökusyonchokwa chichoni, tökutyokwokwa werïnkwa nyay ratate nko Penchamen. Wölo omwoghan nyï le ani lö, ato kewonyeghenanïn monïngö, kuwonyö!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona, kwip pïchay ropöwekwa akwip ropïyen kïnyïl odeny chay kipö tagh akïpa nko werïngwa Penchamen, kutang Misri. Kïpa ntökwitïta wölo mi Yosep. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kisïwa Yosep Penchamen kïmi nko chane, kïlenchï chi nyo kighyongchini konyi, “Mïta pïchï kïpa konyan aiyenchï tany chane aigh omisyö ompöwölo omisïyan nko chane omisyo pöghet.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwigh chichay lenyini kakïmwochï. Kumït toyechay kïpa kö pö Yosep.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kisïwa chane lö kakimïtech kö pö Yosep, kïmïghyö akïngölonchinö lö, “Kakimïtwecha wölete ompö ngalechanya pö ropïyen kikiyokwecha atakinya kikïpkanacha panta nyanya pö tagh tökïnyorï ngölyon nyo kïsïkocha kigheghchin tökïkörchecha kö tökïsarenecha sïkïröyicho, atolapay kwighecha kelïkuna sekeykachi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona kïpa wölo mi chichoni kighyongchini kö pö Yosep akïngölonchï ompö atolekïtö kukat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lö, “Kaykay, echotyon, kikïpkanacha wölete panto tagh kyal omisyö, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kïkany ketacha ato le kö pö to, ketyakacha mïlotwecho, kelecha kiros kesïwecha lö mito ropïyeni chi anka tïkwïl kutito mïlenyi, nka nyete kakiyokucha ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akepucha ngat ropïyeni walaka cho kyolocha omisyewut. Amelö kinkïtöcha chichoni kiyokyï ropïyenichoni mïlotwecha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyokyï chichay lö, “Melö kïgh, mowöghisyö nyonikïny. Tororötïnkwa nko Tororöt pö paponkwa nyo keyokwokwa ropïyenikwo. Ani nyo kyacheng ropïyenikwa.” Atolapay kumïtï Simion kïtuyö nko chane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumït nyu chichoni pïchay kïpa kö pö Yosep, akutö chane pögh kuwunö kelyekwa, kïkany kïpagh sïkïröyikwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kïpechï werko ompö Yosep kutö kïpsach tïkukwa cho kiropchini Yosep ompöwölo kökikemwochï lö omisïyi Yosep nko chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kitï Yosep kaw, kwipchï pïchoni nyinte ropöwekwa cho kipuno korengwa, kïkïtïngchï ntökwit ngwïny ompö konyït. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmak kunkïtï wölo kitöptö chane, atolapay kïtep lö, “Mi pöghisyö paponkwa nyaya kiyosit kyomwowanïkwa ngalechi? Tökïsatate nya?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyokyï lö, “Mito pöghisyö mötworintengu, paponcha, tökïsatate.” Kungïrukisyö ompö tawunyi ompö konyït.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö Yosep otopön tagh kïsïwa Penchamen werïngwa, werto kame, kïlö, “Nka nyete so werïnkwa nyo mïnïng, nyay kyomwowanïkwa?” Kuyokyï lö, “Osoghan Tororöt kusyonchinyi werïnyu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïweghö Yosep atoni panini ompöwölo kitörenguno lok konyichi ompöwölo kisyonchï tya werïngwa, kïwö akïlït konyi akïlok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kiwang kuwun tokochunyi, kukil kegh akïngetunö köyay akïmwatïta kepï omisyö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ketö omisyo Yosep woptanyi onkït, ketö nyo pö werkökwa woptöngwa. Kikigh lenyoni tïkwïl nyo kipö pipö Misri cho kyomisïyi nko nyinte, kikitö pipö Misri omisyengwa woptöngwa ompöwölo melö kikïchömchini pipö Misri kwomisïyi nko pipö Eprania. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtïpï werchay wölo mi Yosep kïrïp kegh nko yiyengwa, kïngetunö poretyengwa ntökwit töwoniontengwa. Kïpechï kuros kegh ompö töngönchin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ketö pïchoni omisyö nyo kimi mesa Yosep, wölo ketö Penchamen kïnyïl mut cho pö werkökwa walaka. Kïlenyona kïgheghsyö akïngörekyö nko Yosep.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mpalaw nyo kepot",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
